---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan, previous: ProjectConcept[] }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for sequenceMilestones. Decompose the project into milestones with dependencies, feedback points, and explicit evidence criteria. Allocate time and resources through exact services, identify critical bottlenecks, and preserve room for learner choice within the required structure. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
